---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import QuoteForm from "../../components/QuoteForm.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../config";

const title = "Brazilian Blowout Elmwood Park, IL | No Downtime Smoothing";
const description =
  "Brazilian blowout in Elmwood Park, IL — smooth, glossy hair with zero downtime. Wash and style the same day. Free quote from a local specialist.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} path="/brazilian-blowout/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose-section">
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium mb-2">
      <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Keratin Treatment Elmwood Park</a> / Brazilian Blowout
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 mb-5">
      Brazilian Blowout in Elmwood Park, IL
    </h1>
    <p>
      A Brazilian blowout is the smoothing treatment for people who don't want to wait around. Unlike a traditional
      keratin treatment, there's no multi-day no-wash period — you can shampoo, sweat, and style the same day you
      leave the salon. It reduces frizz and adds noticeable shine while keeping more of your hair's natural volume
      and movement than a full keratin smoothing service.
    </p>
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <p>
      A stylist applies a smoothing solution strand by strand, then seals it with a flat iron. The treatment coats
      each strand rather than fully relaxing it, which is why some natural wave and body remains — it's smoothing,
      not straightening.
    </p>
    <h2>Who It's For</h2>
    <p>
      Brazilian blowout suits clients who want smoother, more manageable hair without committing to a longer
      appointment or a waiting period, and who'd rather keep some natural texture than go pin-straight. If your hair
      is very thick or coarse and you want maximum frizz reduction, a
      <a href="/" class="text-brand-600 font-medium">traditional keratin treatment</a> may get you closer to that goal.
    </p>
    <h2>Brazilian Blowout vs. Keratin</h2>
    <p>
      See the full side-by-side comparison — downtime, longevity, and results — in our
      <a href="/keratin-vs-brazilian-blowout/" class="text-brand-600 font-medium">Keratin vs. Brazilian Blowout guide →</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Ready to book? <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone}`} class="text-brand-600 font-medium">Call {SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>
      or request a free quote below.
    </p>
  </div>
  <section class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 pb-16">
    <QuoteForm compact />
  </section>
</Layout>
